@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Log in. "@name login" lets later requests reuse the token.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@localtest.co.zw",
  "password": "LocalTest-2026-Admin"
}

### 2. Who am I? Uses the token from request 1.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Wrong password: 401, generic message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@localtest.co.zw",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 4. Unknown email: the SAME message as request 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@localtest.co.zw",
  "password": "LocalTest-2026-Admin"
}

### 5. Deactivated user with the right password: 401, "deactivated"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "former@localtest.co.zw",
  "password": "LocalTest-2026-Admin"
}

### 6. Blank fields: 400 with a list of what's wrong
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 7. No token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me

### 8. Tampered token (one extra letter): 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}x

### 6c-1  Sign up a new company → 201
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Chiedza Logistics",
  "baseCurrency": "USD",
  "adminFullName": "Chiedza Moyo",
  "adminEmail": "chiedza@chiedzalogistics.co.zw",
  "adminPhone": "+263 77 123 4567",
  "password": "Harare-Depot-2026"
}

### 6c-2  The sign-up token works straight away → 200, role ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{signup.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6c-3  Log in with the new account → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "CHIEDZA@chiedzalogistics.co.zw", "password": "Harare-Depot-2026" }

### 6c-4  Same email again → 422 "already exists"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Copycat Ltd",
  "adminFullName": "Someone Else",
  "adminEmail": "chiedza@chiedzalogistics.co.zw",
  "password": "Another-Pass-2026"
}

### 6c-5  Blank name + short password → 400 with an "errors" list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyName": "", "adminFullName": "Tendai", "adminEmail": "tendai@example.co.zw", "password": "short" }

### 6c-6  Password contains the email → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyName": "Tendai Builders", "adminFullName": "Tendai Ncube", "adminEmail": "tendai@builders.co.zw", "password": "tendai-2026-site" }

### 6c-7  Unknown currency → 400 (unreadable request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyName": "Rand Traders", "baseCurrency": "GBP", "adminFullName": "Sipho Dube", "adminEmail": "sipho@randtraders.co.zw", "password": "Beitbridge-Run-2026" }